# IG tooling: SUSHI and the packages/validator it downloads. The FSH under ig/input/fsh is the
# source of record.
#
# ig/fsh-generated IS committed, deliberately: the runtime validator loads those profiles off
# the classpath, and the Docker build runs Maven without node, so it cannot regenerate them.
# Rebuild with `cd ig && npx sushi .` after editing any FSH — IgProfilesTest fails if the
# committed output no longer covers what the code expects.
ig/node_modules/
ig/.pkg/
